{"title":"The Briar Heart","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">The Briar Heart is a named <a href=\"#/monster/elder-briar-warden\">Elder Briar Warden</a> seen at level 52.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find The Briar Heart</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Maw's%20Sands\">Old Maw&#39;s Sands</a></li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"the-briar-heart\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"shagbark-crossbow\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/8a1688d1a058b3ae630d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Shagbark Crossbow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"briar-heart-seed\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a3dbd32486d7653d121e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Briar Heart Seed</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"thorn-cutting\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/32fe2a6f1fb8885c9afb.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thorn Cutting</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"wild-rose-hip\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/97ed0af0ce528f53d233.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wild Rose Hip</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"briarwood\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/5a164111773bd319e75c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Briarwood</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/dc99e407833d39dfdb68.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>The Briar Heart</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/elder-briar-warden\">Elder Briar Warden</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>52</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>990</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>2 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}